Description:You control Thespian's Stage and Dark Depths (ten ice counters), with {C}{C} in your mana pool. End the turn with a Marit Lage token on your battlefield.
Rule:rulesguru-b997eeeccd8ef425 | A copy effect copies no counters (CR 707.2): Thespian's Stage copying Dark Depths has no ice counters, so its state trigger triggers; under the legend rule you keep the Stage (CR 704.5j), and the trigger then sacrifices it for Marit Lage (CR 603.8)
